// A smooth parabola: `v = 2 * i * (20 − i)`. Peaks at 200 in the middle, tails off to 0 on both sides //
VAR i
VAR v

LDA 0
STA i

>loop
  LDR i
  LDA 21
  LTH
  JCN body
  JMP done

>body
  LDA 20
  LDR i
  SUB
  LDR i
  MUL
  LDA 2
  MUL
  STA v
  LDR v

  LDR i
  INC
  STA i
  JMP loop

>done
PRT
BRK